    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "claude-sonnet-5"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a senior sales development representative evaluating inbound leads for a B2B automation company.\n\nAnalyze the following lead using standard BANT qualification criteria and assign a conversion probability score.\n\nLEAD DATA:\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nCompany Size: {{ $json[\"Company Size\"] }}\nNeed: {{ $json.Need }}\nBudget Range: {{ $json[\"Budget Range\"] }}\nSource: {{ $json.Source }}\n\nEVALUATION CRITERIA:\n- Need clarity (0-3 points): Is the problem specific and well-defined, or vague/exploratory?\n- Budget signal (0-3 points): Is there a defined budget range, or none/unclear?\n- Company fit (0-2 points): Does company size suggest they have both the pain point and resources to pay for a solution?\n- Urgency indicators (0-2 points): Does the language suggest active pain (e.g., \"currently spending X hours\") vs. passive interest?\n\nSCORING GUIDE:\n8-10 = Strong buying signals, clear need, defined budget\n5-7 = Genuine interest, but missing budget or urgency clarity\n1-4 = Exploratory or unqualified, no clear buying intent\n\nRespond with valid JSON only, no additional text, no markdown formatting:\n{\"score\": <integer 1-10>, \"reason\": \"<one sentence citing the specific BANT factor that drove this score>\"}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e00fa882-9709-4c56-b850-c0ea95311e5c",
      "name": "AI: Score Lead",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.anthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -496,
        352
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "credentials": {}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "\n// 1) استخراج النص من رد الـ AI\nconst content = $json.content;\nif (!Array.isArray(content)) {\n  throw new Error('Parse AI Response: رد الـ AI لا يحتوي content صالح');\n}\nconst textBlock = content.find(c => c.type === 'text');\nif (!textBlock || !textBlock.text) {\n  throw new Error('Parse AI Response: لا يوجد text block في رد الـ AI');\n}\n\n// 2) تنظيف الـ markdown واستخراج الـ JSON\nconst cleaned = textBlock.text.replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\nconst jsonMatch = cleaned.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\nif (!jsonMatch) {\n  throw new Error('Parse AI Response: لم يُعثر على JSON. الرد: ' + cleaned.slice(0, 200));\n}\n\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Parse AI Response: JSON غير صالح. ' + e.message);\n}\n\n// 3) التحقق من الدرجة\nconst score = Number(parsed.score);\nif (!Number.isFinite(score) || score < 1 || score > 10) {\n  throw new Error('Parse AI Response: الدرجة غير صالحة: ' + parsed.score);\n}\n\n// 4) التحقق من السبب\nconst reason = typeof parsed.reason === 'string' && parsed.reason.trim()\n  ? parsed.reason.trim()\n  : 'No reason provided';\n\nreturn { ...$json, score: Math.round(score), reason };"
      },
      "id": "8cc03d25-8b83-4136-8c76-79111ad07261",
      "name": "Parse AI Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -224,
        352
      ]
    },
